            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Genda uvuge aya majambo werekeye i burārūko, uti Garuka, yewe Isirayeli Inamusubiranyuma, ni jewe Uhoraho mbivuze. Sinzokurābana ishavu, kuko nd’ umunyembabazi, ni jewe Uhoraho mbivuze; kandi sinzokwamana uburake imisi yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pfa kwemera gusa ukugabitanya kwawe, ko wancumuyeko, jewe Uhoraho Imana yawe, ugakwiragira irya n’ino ku mana z’inyamahanga musi y’igiti cose gitōtahaye, ntiwumvire ijwi ryanje, ni jewe Uhoraho mbivuze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
